    <description>DIR-869: NOT CURRENTLY CALLED (deactivated 2026-08-27) - kept for reference only. Would overwrite RES_Approval_Request_Remarks__c on the latest ApprovalWorkItem with a decision comment. Was called from RES_Quote_Discount_DOA_Approval_Flow's Overwrite_Manager_Work_Item_Comments / Overwrite_Finance_Work_Item_Comments steps, which have been removed: the architect confirmed the submitter's original comment in RES_Approval_Request_Remarks__c should be preserved unmodified throughout the approval process, since the approver's own decision comment is already shown separately in the native, platform-populated ApprovalWorkItem.Comments field once they act - no automation needed for that side.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>RES Set Approval Work Item Comments {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
